# Wrangler / Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# .env is intentionally committed: this is a Lovable-managed project and
# Lovable Cloud's build/deploy pipeline reads SUPABASE_URL/SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
# directly from it. The values it holds are the Supabase anon/publishable key,
# which is meant to be public (access control is enforced by RLS policies, not
# by hiding this key) — safe to commit, unlike a service-role key or other secret.
# Only personal local overrides are ignored.
.env.local
.env.*.local

